<p dir="auto">This work attempts to reduce much of the property-specific language and expand the value type to include repeat and auto-repeat for properties that accept comma separated lists of values</p>
<p dir="auto">Part of <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4718339915" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/openwebdocs/project/issues/238" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/openwebdocs/project/issues/238/hovercard" href="https://github.com/openwebdocs/project/issues/238">openwebdocs/project#238</a></p>
<p dir="auto"><code class="notranslate">&lt;line-width&gt;</code> is added in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4767573947" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44597" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/pull/44597/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44597">#44597</a><br>
the gap decoration properties will be added soon.</p>]]></content>
